            "value": "Gardées pour une occasion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept when Encave could not read your cellar at launch. Share one to keep it elsewhere or to report the problem; delete it when you no longer need it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conservés quand Encave n’a pas pu lire votre cave au lancement. Partagez-en un pour le garder ailleurs ou signaler le problème ; supprimez-le quand vous n’en avez plus besoin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept with the wine and used for the estimated value of your cellar in Insights.": {
