    "Pinch to zoom in and out. On the Mac, and on the iPad in a wide window, the zoom buttons at the top and ⌘+ and ⌘– work too. On iPhone and iPad, **Bottle List** lists the bottles of the storage position by position; on the Mac, the list is beside the drawing.": {
